%% ==========================================================================
%% CivicEye - UML Statechart (issue lifecycle)
%% Source: ValidationService.validateStatusTransition / AppConstants
%% Allowed: Pending -> In Progress, Pending -> Resolved, In Progress -> Resolved
%% Resolved is terminal; backwards moves are rejected.
%% ==========================================================================
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB

    [*] --> Draft : Citizen opens 'Report a New Issue'

    Draft --> Draft : Edit form fields
    Draft --> Pending : Submit Issue and form is valid

    Pending --> Pending : Invalid transition rejected
    Pending --> InProgress : Admin selects 'In Progress'
    Pending --> Resolved : Admin selects 'Resolved'

    InProgress --> InProgress : Invalid transition rejected
    InProgress --> Resolved : Admin selects 'Resolved'

    Resolved --> Resolved : Terminal state, no further change
    Resolved --> [*] : Issue closed

    note right of Pending
        Status is set to Pending by
        IssueService.submitIssue.
        Only an Admin may move an
        issue out of this state.
    end note

    note right of InProgress
        An Admin may not move the
        issue back to Pending.
    end note

    note right of Resolved
        Resolved is a terminal state:
        every further transition
        is refused by the service.
    end note
